# Migrations are sha256-locked by packages/db/src/migrate.ts — the hash covers the RAW
# BYTES, line endings included. Without this, a CRLF checkout on Windows would change every
# applied migration's hash and the runner would refuse to run with a message that reads like
# sabotage. Never remove this line.
*.sql text eol=lf

# Keep every other text file normalised too, for the same class of reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must not be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
